("drought", "At the worst point, daily slots were cut to around twenty. Lines of ships stretched out at sea, and some shipping companies sent their vessels the long way, through Suez or even around Africa. A few dry months in Central America changed shipping costs all over the world."),
("drought", "Now Panama is preparing a new reservoir on the Río Indio, so that the next drought does not shut the shortcut."),
